    "created_at": "2019-03-26T11:40:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-26T11:40:58Z",
    "body": "That sounds like an argument against XML5, since it produces weird and un-semantic results. Whereas the OP's framing make it sound like nested p tags are a desired feature.",
